1
00:00:40,955 --> 00:00:45,395
=My Loong=

2
00:00:45,395 --> 00:00:48,521
=Episode 4=

3
00:01:02,679 --> 00:01:04,439
- Xingyao!
- Wangshu!

4
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,280
Are you all right?

5
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,640
I'm fine.

6
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,599
Did they hurt you?

7
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,959
It was Zhang Jin,
using Aunt's promise of marriage,

8
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,799
but it's fine now.

9
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,760
You're back.

10
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,760
Xingyao!

11
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
What are you doing?

12
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,159
They saw us. Kill them.

13
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,480
It's easier that way.

14
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:40,599
No!

15
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:42,799
Why?

16
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:46,480
If you kill them,
the Zhang family won't let it go.

17
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,760
Once they start investigating,

18
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:51,400
word of my return
will reach the Yue family.

19
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,000
If Jiang Liuying finds out I'm alive,

20
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,319
she'll use even crueler means
against my sister and me.

21
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,280
Then I'll kill them all.

22
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,120
Lizhi, listen to me.

23
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:07,920
Killing a few people is easy,
but what good will it do?

24
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,840
Making such a scene
will get us both targeted.

25
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,680
You might be fine, but I'm only mortal.

26
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,759
If someone catches me off guard,

27
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:16,800
with our fate linked,

28
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,800
no one can control your Li Fire.

29
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,639
Then you won't be able to go home,
and I won't survive.

30
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,560
When we were coming back,

31
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:27,199
the flood loong guarding you
told me to keep your secret safe,

32
00:02:27,919 --> 00:02:29,599
to keep you from making a scene, right?

33
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:53,479
(They are arguing?)

34
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:02,159
He wants to take you away.

35
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:03,319
I cannot stop him.

36
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:06,280
But you must promise me one thing.

37
00:03:06,892 --> 00:03:10,000
Never tell anyone about the Loong Abyss,

38
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:14,719
nor reveal his identity to anyone.

39
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,840
Then I'll kill everyone except you.

40
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:26,479
She saw, so I'll kill her too.

41
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:28,039
Shut up!

42
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:32,280
I was a fool
to even try reasoning with you.

43
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,400
When I say no, it means no!
Just listen to me!

44
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,599
Are you ordering me?

45
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,840
What if I am?

46
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:43,199
You need my help.

47
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,919
So act like it.

48
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,520
Otherwise, we're done.

49
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,159
If you force me,

50
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,080
I'll end my own life.

51
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:54,719
Let's see
who'll suppress your Li Fire then.

52
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,000
Your call or mine?

53
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,240
What... What just happened?

54
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,639
A loong! There was a loong!

55
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:54,040
And that woman was on its back!

56
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,560
Zhang Jin forced an unwanted marriage,
defying Heaven's will!

57
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:05,160
The Loong Lord was enraged
and unleashed punishment!

58
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,040
Go back and tell your master

59
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:09,279
that the Loong Lord shields Yue Xingyao!

60
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,439
Any mortal betrothal is null and void!

61
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:15,480
Dare harass her again,
and your heads will be next!

62
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,600
- Loong Lord, have mercy!
- Loong Lord, have mercy!

63
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,079
- Have mercy!
- Have mercy!

64
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:21,759
I was wrong!

65
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:22,959
Get lost!

66
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,079
This beats killing, right?

67
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,560
Much more fun too.

68
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,680
Annoying.

69
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,519
Be good.

70
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,639
Come on. Let's go home.

71
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Let's get Xingyao.

72
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:14,700
Xingyao,

73
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,390
you're awake.

74
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,920
Where... Where is this?

75
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:32,920
This is the retreat
Mother used when gathering herbs.

76
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:36,480
We brought you here after you fainted.

77
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,560
You?

78
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:43,120
The loong? That loong is...

79
00:06:44,839 --> 00:06:47,519
(In six months,
with the Loong Lord's help,)

80
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,879
(I'll surely fix the Yues' problems.)

81
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,560
(I just can't
let Xingyao know the truth.)

82
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,319
(She'd worry too much.)

83
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:57,079
Wangshu?

84
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,000
That's...

85
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,000
That loong...

86
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:06,720
He... He's the Loong Lord's guard.

87
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,360
The Loong Lord's guard?

88
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:12,279
After I was swept beneath the water,
I met the Loong Lord.

89
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,680
He was nice.

90
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,720
He knew I missed you,

91
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,480
so he even sent someone
to escort me back.

92
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,160
The Loong Lord?

93
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,720
So you and the Loong Lord...

94
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,800
I am his bride, after all.

95
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,959
But he has his own home.

96
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,199
He's only trapped here for now

97
00:07:38,879 --> 00:07:40,439
and will leave in six months.

98
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:46,439
He also promised
that I can stay in the mortal realm.

99
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,200
What are you wearing?

100
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,960
This is the mortal bridal attire.

101
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,679
Back in the Loong Abyss,

102
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:59,720
my clothes and jewelry were all...

103
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,200
Never mind.

104
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,120
Let's go inside.

105
00:09:36,056 --> 00:09:37,852
♪If the wind were a verb♪

106
00:09:38,247 --> 00:09:40,847
♪Blowing through my thoughts♪

107
00:09:41,453 --> 00:09:43,516
♪Touching, then vanishing away♪

108
00:09:43,794 --> 00:09:46,417
♪Spreading throughout my heart♪

109
00:09:47,118 --> 00:09:51,457
♪I flipped when we met in our youth♪

110
00:09:52,836 --> 00:09:57,252
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

111
00:09:58,521 --> 00:10:00,841
♪If love were a noun♪

112
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,799
We can go inside.

113
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:09,058
♪I softly murmur your name
between heartbeats♪

114
00:10:09,754 --> 00:10:14,931
♪As ripples stir
in the corner of our eyes♪

115
00:10:15,333 --> 00:10:21,735
♪Wherever our gazes meet,
passion settles♪

116
00:10:23,648 --> 00:10:26,608
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

117
00:10:26,608 --> 00:10:28,678
♪Take root after drowning♪

118
00:10:29,419 --> 00:10:33,080
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

119
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,080
You're trembling.

120
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:35,919
Are you cold?

121
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,360
No.

122
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,720
I just remembered the past...

123
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,919
My Lord, our senses are linked.

124
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,720
You should be able to feel it.

125
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,000
Forget it.

126
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,879
It probably means nothing to you anyway.

127
00:11:02,759 --> 00:11:04,240
You brought me back to see my sister

128
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:08,120
and handled things just as I asked.

129
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,960
I'm truly grateful.

130
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,720
Now,

131
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,679
I will repay you as promised.

132
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:19,039
But

133
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,960
could you please

134
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,960
let me handle it?

135
00:11:32,753 --> 00:11:35,008
♪If love were a noun♪

136
00:11:35,008 --> 00:11:37,798
♪Woven with pain♪

137
00:11:38,193 --> 00:11:43,273
♪I softly murmur your name
between heartbeats♪

138
00:11:43,964 --> 00:11:48,279
♪As ripples stir
in the corner of our eyes♪

139
00:11:48,279 --> 00:11:49,279
Shut up.

140
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,120
Sleep.

141
00:11:57,837 --> 00:12:00,861
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

142
00:12:00,861 --> 00:12:03,069
♪Take root after drowning♪

143
00:12:03,437 --> 00:12:09,037
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

144
00:12:09,037 --> 00:12:14,669
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

145
00:12:14,669 --> 00:12:20,259
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

146
00:12:20,259 --> 00:12:25,923
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

147
00:12:25,923 --> 00:12:31,556
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

148
00:12:31,556 --> 00:12:37,177
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

149
00:12:37,391 --> 00:12:46,561
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

150
00:12:52,022 --> 00:12:54,769
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

151
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:57,039
What?

152
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,200
You couldn't find her?

153
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,399
Didn't I station men

154
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,200
to assist during the ritual?

155
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,840
Yes.

156
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,720
Following your orders,

157
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,919
I stationed men
around the Loong Abyss early on.

158
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:10,360
But the storm at Loong Abyss
on that day was too fierce.

159
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,399
The waters were violent.

160
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:13,720
Our rescue team
couldn't get anywhere near.

161
00:13:13,919 --> 00:13:17,000
These past few days,
I led men to search the nearby waters.

162
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,559
But there has been no sign
of Lady Wangshu.

163
00:13:19,799 --> 00:13:22,399
I fear she has already...

164
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,039
Your Highness.

165
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:33,519
Your Highness, Lady Xingyao
has also been searching for her.

166
00:13:33,519 --> 00:13:35,399
- Should we...
- Tell her.

167
00:13:37,759 --> 00:13:40,853
The rescue operation
involved the ritual.

168
00:13:41,292 --> 00:13:43,080
The fewer people who knew, the better.

169
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:45,799
Had it been exposed,
the fallout would have been disastrous.

170
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,919
That's why I didn't tell her beforehand.

171
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,200
If she had let her guard down,

172
00:13:52,559 --> 00:13:54,200
it would have raised suspicion.

173
00:13:55,559 --> 00:13:56,559
Now,

174
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,440
there's no need anymore.

175
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:03,679
Tell her.

176
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:08,519
Her health has always been frail,
so she doesn't need to keep searching.

177
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,279
Wangshu

178
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:14,159
wouldn't want to see Xingyao
like this either.

179
00:14:14,799 --> 00:14:15,799
Remember.

180
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,320
Don't let my father know.

181
00:14:17,679 --> 00:14:19,039
I need some time alone.

182
00:14:21,399 --> 00:14:22,399
You may leave now.

183
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,120
Yes, Young Lord.

184
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,759
Wangshu...

185
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,320
I failed to protect you.

186
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,320
It's all my fault.

187
00:14:44,327 --> 00:14:47,266
(General's Manor)

188
00:14:47,266 --> 00:14:50,237
(Boundless Virtue and Favor)

189
00:14:55,987 --> 00:14:58,070
(Boundless Virtue and Favor)

190
00:15:01,879 --> 00:15:03,240
This color suits you best.

191
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:07,200
My Lady, everything here is so gorgeous.

192
00:15:13,399 --> 00:15:15,679
This hairpin matches the wedding gown.
Don't you think?

193
00:15:15,679 --> 00:15:17,000
You look stunning in everything.

194
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,398
The Young Lord will surely love it.

195
00:15:18,759 --> 00:15:19,759
You sweet talker.

196
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,480
My... My Lady.

197
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:32,720
The Young Lord did arrange her rescue
during the ritual.

198
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,919
He still hasn't given up,
and sent men to search for her!

199
00:15:35,919 --> 00:15:37,639
That is indeed what I heard.

200
00:15:41,679 --> 00:15:44,320
What if she really is alive,
there is no Loong Lord,

201
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,240
and he brings her back?

202
00:15:51,711 --> 00:15:56,286
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

203
00:15:57,061 --> 00:16:01,558
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

204
00:16:04,797 --> 00:16:09,919
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

205
00:16:09,919 --> 00:16:13,258
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

206
00:16:13,258 --> 00:16:14,622
♪Refusing to forget♪

207
00:16:18,288 --> 00:16:23,065
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

208
00:16:23,616 --> 00:16:25,406
♪He cannot learn them♪

209
00:16:25,406 --> 00:16:28,541
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

210
00:16:31,693 --> 00:16:34,017
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

211
00:16:34,017 --> 00:16:36,380
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

212
00:16:36,958 --> 00:16:39,622
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

213
00:16:39,622 --> 00:16:41,380
♪Their days ahead are long♪
